@startuml 13-zones
!include theme-oriolrius.puml
title Zones: separate trust domains in one PKI Manager
left to right direction

package "zone: prod" {
  rectangle "User CA (prod)" as up <<user>>
  rectangle "Host CA (prod)" as hp <<host>>
  rectangle "web1.acme.example\n(prod)" as wp <<machine>>
  rectangle "Alice (prod identity)" as ap <<file>>
}
package "zone: staging" {
  rectangle "User CA (staging)" as us <<user>>
  rectangle "Host CA (staging)" as hs <<host>>
  rectangle "web1.acme.example\n(staging)" as ws <<machine>>
  rectangle "Alice (staging identity)" as as <<file>>
}
up --> wp : trusted
us --> ws : trusted
us -[$RED,dashed]-> wp : <color:#C62828>never trusted</color>
legend bottom
  A host trusts only its own zone's User CA. Revocations and blocks stay in the zone.
  Names unique per zone · one identity per person per zone · zone is fixed (offboard + re-enrol)
  · archive, don't delete · with 2+ zones every request must name its zone (fleet tokens carry it).
endlegend
@enduml
